{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/785818-electrical-sight-vs-electromagnetic-linguistics","id":785818,"title":"Electrical Sight vs. Electromagnetic Linguistics","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-14T01:28:56-08:00","id":785818,"title":"Electrical Sight vs. Electromagnetic Linguistics","content":"<span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Posting them here from the books, for ease of comparison.</span></span> <hr /><br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><u><b>Electrical Sight</b></u><br /> <br /> Angels designed to deal with circuits and complex computational Infrastructure are supplied with the ability to see and understand the signals they are working with. This very same ability is extremely useful to demons when they need to intercept signals or listen in on communications.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Appearance:</b> Static fills the demon's eyes as if on an old television with bad reception.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>System:</b> The demon can see electrical signals in the air around him, within the objects they are traveling through, and along cable lines. The demon is able to see each separate signal and could easily follow one to its source. With a successful Intelligence + Composure roll, the demon can easily pick out one specific signal and understand the transmission, whether analog or digital. He can listen to phone conversations or watch television broadcasts just by concentrating on the signal.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><u>Electromagnetic Linguistics</u></span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Prerequisite:</b> Demon; Computers 1</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">You are more in tune with the &quot;machine&quot; portion of the God-Machine than most. In addition to all native human languages, you can decipher machine code, programming languages, and even electromagnetic signals. This can range from reading a piece of computer code and instinctively understanding what the program is intended to do to &quot;hearing&quot; text messages as they zip through the air. Wireless broadcasts can be plucked from the air, but information sent via landline requires you to physically plug a cable into your body. (This doesn't inflict any damage, but it's disconcerting and counts as a compromise if you're under Cover.) Encrypted data isn't automatically deciphered, but you can try to hack it just like if you had the data on a computer.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">In especially signal-dense areas, like major first-world cities where lots of people have smartphones and wi-fi networks and such, the Storyteller might call for a Wits + Composure roll to isolate a particular transmission, much like trying to listen to a single conversation in a crowded room.</span></span> <hr /><br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Could anyone help clarify for me why an Unchained player would want to get both the Merit and the Modification? Or, conversely, which of these two is more superior?</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-14T01:40:49-08:00","id":785822,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/239635-electric-sight-radio-suite-and-computational-linguistics\">We did this thread already</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-14T05:57:53-08:00","id":785918,"title":"","content":"Electrical sight lets you follow signals to their source and see codes that flow through non-wireless computers.<br /> Electromagnetic Linguistics lets you read any computer code and instantly understand the function of any program.<br /> <br /> Two things one does but the other does not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-14T06:11:29-08:00","id":785927,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/785818-electrical-sight-vs-electromagnetic-linguistics?p=785822#post785822\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/239635-electric-sight-radio-suite-and-computational-linguistics\">We did this thread already</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Noted. Thanks.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MCN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/785818-electrical-sight-vs-electromagnetic-linguistics?p=785918#post785918\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Electrical sight lets you follow signals to their source and see codes that flow through non-wireless computers.<br /> Electromagnetic Linguistics lets you read any computer code and instantly understand the function of any program.<br /> <br /> Two things 